## Negotiated modifier
    App negotiates R8G8B8A8_UNORM from the APP (RADV) device TRUE caps. The layer
    validates the negotiated modifier on the GAME device (ANV). A RADV-only proper
    DRM modifier is not advertised by ANV, so negotiation MUST return the LINEAR
    fallback (modifier == EXCHANGE_MODIFIER_LINEAR), mirroring the layer's proven
    swapchain.cpp cross-device path (gameCaps vs a LINEAR-only proxy).

